[en.FOCUS_C09_INTER_OPEN_UP_SADDLE]
Influence Saddle Arabia

[en.FOCUS_C09_INTER_OPEN_UP_SADDLE_desc]
Saddle Arabia has not yet engaged in large-scale foreign trade, but we can exert influence to encourage them to change.

[zh.FOCUS_C09_INTER_OPEN_UP_SADDLE]
影响鞍拉伯

[zh.FOCUS_C09_INTER_OPEN_UP_SADDLE_desc]
鞍拉伯如今还没有进行大规模的对外贸易，但我们可以施加影响力，推动他们做出改变。

